// nobody waits for (runs/nested-subagents-nowait: the main thread spawned one
// and said DONE, the stream has no wait and the running sub-agent was aborted),
// where the mock's spawn_agent waits for the sub-agent it starts, so its stream
// has the wait that follows and no sub-agent is left running.
